        "answer": "Yes, it triggers.  If an effect's trigger conditions are met when the effect is gained, that effect will trigger.  In this case, your opponent no longer has Digimon with digivolution cards at the same timing as when your opponent's Digimon is deleted in battle, therefore you can activate ＜Piercing＞.",
